  "tagline": "The most popular IndexedDB wrapper, with live queries and an optional Dexie Cloud sync service.",
  "description": "Dexie.js is a thin, promise-based wrapper around IndexedDB that gives you a readable schema declaration, compound and multi-entry indexes, transactions and a fluent query API, plus liveQuery() hooks that re-run when underlying data changes. It is the pragmatic default for web apps that want local persistence without learning raw IndexedDB. Sync, authentication and access control come from Dexie Cloud, a commercial service from the same author that can also be self-hosted. Because it is still IndexedDB underneath, queries stay index-driven: no joins, aggregates or full-text search.",
